Feature: Generated process server REST contracts
 Scenario: Publish a typed process to the worker queue after committing its state
  Given generated process host
  When I construct a REST request with header "x-chenile-tenant-id" and value "tenant0"
  And I POST a REST request to URL "/{{testServiceId}}" with payload
  """
  {"filename":"generated-test.dat"}
  """
  Then the REST response key "processType" is "{{testProcessType}}"
  And the REST response key "tenant" is "tenant0"
  And the committed process is published to Kafka
